# of the tool output they captured (a Windows device's CRLF JSON, apt output,
# ldd, test and build logs). Their bytes stay as recorded; these lines only stop
# `git diff --check` from reporting those lines as whitespace errors.
# cr-at-eol: CRLF line ends. -trailing-space: spaces at the end of a line.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
